    "climbable": null,
    "drive_up": false,
    "trail_note": "From Sumpter, follow the Elkhorn Scenic Byway west 11.7 miles, turn right onto gravel Road 7370, then turn right on Road 100 for 0.2 miles to the trailhead on the left, where a berm blocks an old road. Hike of 3.5 miles with about 2,300 ft of elevation gain (2023 visit page)."
  },
